{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id219555264"}, "name":{"label":"Ghostmama2"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-28T11:07:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"14604286380"}, "title":{"label":"Not Your Everyday Weather App"}, "content":{"label":"First of all, if you want to have any fun at all with this app, don't set it to professional. Move the slider to the middle or all the way down. This is such a fun app! I just started using it and so far, I've done missions, got called a meathead, had a song sung to me about the weather, on top of the normal checking the weather (radar, forecast, etc.) and this is all on the free version. This morning, there was a high pollen count alert so I unlocked so when I opened the app it said something like, \"Congratulations! You earned the Blow Me Achievement” and it had a tissue (for blowing your nose) lol! You will love this if you have this kind of sense of humor. If you don’t, it’s still an awesome app. Just set it to professional!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
