{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id110464291"}, "name":{"label":"Slipknott3523"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-06T10:39:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"14518437601"}, "title":{"label":"Temperature Forecasting"}, "content":{"label":"Carrot has consistently done a poor job of forecasting the temperatures of coming days. During this summer, the actual temperature is consistently 3-7 degrees warmer than their forecast. I don’t understand how they could be so wrong so often unless the government source being used is purposely used to minimize these temps for political reason, or the staff putting these projections together are poorly trained.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
